@startuml

title CJM: Создание и получение заказа пользователем

actor "Пользователь" as User
participant "Avito Kitchen" as Kitchen
participant "Restaurant Service" as Restaurant

== Выбор ресторана ==

User -> Kitchen: GET /restaurants
Kitchen --> User: Список ресторанов

== Просмотр меню ==

User -> Kitchen: GET /restaurants/{id}/products
Kitchen -> Restaurant: GET /api/v1/products
Restaurant --> Kitchen: Список продуктов
Kitchen --> User: Меню ресторана

== Создание заказа ==

User -> Kitchen: POST /orders
Kitchen -> Kitchen: Создать заказ в своей БД
Kitchen -> Restaurant: POST /api/v1/orders
Restaurant --> Kitchen: restaurant_order_id
Kitchen -> Kitchen: Сохранить restaurant_order_id
Kitchen --> User: Заказ создан

== Обработка заказа ==

Restaurant -> Kitchen: POST /integration/orders/status\nstatus = accepted
Kitchen --> Restaurant: 200 OK

Restaurant -> Kitchen: POST /integration/orders/status\nstatus = cooking
Kitchen --> Restaurant: 200 OK

Restaurant -> Kitchen: POST /integration/orders/status\nstatus = ready
Kitchen --> Restaurant: 200 OK

== Просмотр заказа ==

User -> Kitchen: GET /orders/{id}
Kitchen --> User: Детали заказа и текущий статус

@enduml